msgctxt "76"
msgid "This is West Park? What the hell happened to it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Where's all the homeless and their big old tent community?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"A building called Kamurocho Hills should've gone up here by now, but it's "
"still a vacant lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "This is where I met my boss for the first time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "But the place I used to know is gone now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Boss..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "It's been a while, Tatsumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "What are you doing here, boss?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"I heard from the young bucks you were back in town. Had a feeling you'd "
"stop by West Park sooner or later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"You been usin' the family to get revenge on me? Is that what this is all "
"about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Not even close. You and I live in different worlds now, Tatsumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"After you went to prison, I cut you off from the family. Officially and "
"personally. You got no place in Kamurocho now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Even if I forgave you for the past, we still got plenty of boys who want "
"you dead in the ground, no compromises."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "And I ain't got enough power to calm 'em all down myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "So get the hell out. Don't ever show your face in this city again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Yeah. Guess that's the only solution."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Hey, boss? Can I ask you one more thing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "My son. What happened with my son?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Don't worry about that. He's livin' safe and sound with his mother, way out "
"in Tochigi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "You tell him...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "We told him you're dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "He thinks I'm dead, huh...? Yeah, that's... I guess that's for the best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "...I'm outta here, boss. Take care of yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Tatsumi... Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Thanks for lookin' after Tatsumi for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"Here's a little token of my appreciation. Oughta come in handy for a guy "
"like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Blood Brooch<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"He's really a good man. Not cut out for this business. Guy like him belongs "
"on the straight and narrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "(Tatsumi's boss seems to respect what kind of guy he is.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

